1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Setiap kali kamu
buka website,

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,780
HP-mu diam-diam
menjalankan

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:05,880
misi pencarian alamat
keliling dunia.

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,440
Komputer aslinya cuma
ngerti alamat angka,

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,140
atau IP Address.

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,760
Nah, DNS adalah buku
kontak raksasa internet

7
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:16,400
yang mencocokkan nama
website dengan angkanya

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,080
di dalam sebuah tabel
bernama DNS Table.

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,000
Saat kamu ketik
nama website,

10
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,680
HP-mu pertama-tama
nanya ke Router di rumah.

11
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,050
Kalau Router nggak tahu,

12
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,620
dia oper tugas ini
ke aktor utama kita:

13
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,300
DNS Resolver,

14
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,960
si kurir pencari alamat!

15
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,980
Di sini ada
dua cara kerja.

16
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,900
Pertama, cara Rekursif.

17
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,520
HP dan Router kamu
cuma bilang ke Resolver:

18
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,140
"Tolong cariin,
sampai ketemu!"

19
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,980
Lalu, mereka duduk santai
nunggu hasil akhirnya.

20
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,740
Kedua, cara Iteratif.

21
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,020
Si Resolver yang kerja
keras keliling

22
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,400
bertanya satu per satu.

23
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,920
Dia tanya ke Root Server,

24
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,420
si kantor pusat dunia.

25
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,860
Root Server menunjuk
ke TLD Server,

26
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:56,100
pengelola akhiran
seperti .com atau .id.

27
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,240
Terakhir, dia diarahkan
ke Server Autoritatif

28
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:01,180
yang memegang
DNS Table asli.

29
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:02,560
Begitu angkanya ketemu,

30
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:04,800
websitenya langsung
kebuka dalam sekejap!

31
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,000
Tapi, hati-hati!

32
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,280
DNS juga punya
celah keamanan.

33
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:10,180
Lewat serangan
DNS Spoofing

34
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:12,000
atau meracuni
catatan DNS,

35
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:14,460
hacker bisa menyelipkan
nomor IP palsu.

36
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:16,120
Kamu ketik alamat
bank asli,

37
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:18,540
tapi malah diarahkan
ke situs penipu!

38
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:22,160
Makanya, pastikan koneksi
dan DNS-mu terenkripsi,

39
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,850
biar buku kontak internetmu
nggak pernah dibajak!

